  "body": "4 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Internal Garage | Macleans Zone\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity for families looking to get into the highly sought-after Macleans College zone. This low-maintenance home offers practical space, great school zoning, and a peaceful cul-de-sac location.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n•  Freehold title — 177m² section, easy-care land\r\n•  178m² floor area across two levels, perfect for family living\r\n•  4 bedrooms & 2.5 bathrooms, including one ensuite\r\n•  Double internal-access garage + possible one extra onsite parking\r\n•  Plenty of off-street parking\r\n•  Brand new property with 10-year builder guarantee and one-year free maintenance period\r\n•  Functional open plan living and dining with seamless flow to outdoor space\r\n• Modern kitchen, great storage, and natural light throughout\r\n\r\nIn-Zone for Top Schools\r\n\r\n•  Macleans College\r\n•  Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n•  Pigeon Mountain Primary School\r\n(3 of East Auckland’s most prestigious schools — all within easy reach)\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Location:\r\n\r\n•  Walk to Bucklands Beach and local parks\r\n•  Close to Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry service to CBD, and supermarket\r\n•  Quiet and family-friendly neighbourhood with excellent community feel\r\n\r\n Why You'll Love It:\r\n\r\nThis home offers smart space, top education options, and lock-up-and-leave convenience in one of East Auckland’s best school zones. A fantastic option for families, investors, or anyone looking for location and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nCall now to book your private viewing – this one won’t last!",
